  m_Name: ModePreview_Rampage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Mode: 2
  Notes: 'Rampage''s whole arena IS its cell config (the cactus forest ringing the membrane and the crystals respawning in the nucleus), so this needs no structure prop. Intensity 1 of four - the forest is identical at every intensity, only the crystal count changes, so intensity is the wrong dial for a preview and 1 is the most forgiving. PrismsDestroyed counts solo exactly as it does in a match: environment mass is hostile by colour.'
  PreviewCell: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc20698b2b983f9e1e9c20733ea92760, type: 2}
